Overland for Android
Copyright 2026 happytechca

This app is a from-scratch Kotlin remake of the deprecated Overland for Android
(https://github.com/OpenHumans/Overland_android, Apache License 2.0,
Copyright 2020 Nicolas Eberlé). No source code was carried over; the launcher
icon is redrawn after that project's icon.

It sends data in the format of Overland for iOS by Aaron Parecki
(https://github.com/aaronpk/Overland-iOS, Apache License 2.0).
